# Graphify: keep only outputs needed for future bounded queries
# (graph.json for `graphify query`/`path`/`explain`, GRAPH_REPORT.md for
# humans). Everything else is machine-local state, a regenerable cache, or
# bookkeeping that isn't needed to query the graph.
graphify-out/cache/
graphify-out/cost.json
graphify-out/manifest.json
graphify-out/.graphify_*
graphify-out/.vocab.txt
graphify-out/graph.html
graphify-out/reflections/
graphify-out/20??-??-??/

